{"version":1,"content":"<p>向來被視為時尚界寵兒的藝人Angelababy（楊穎），近日現身上海出席品牌聖誕亮燈活動。</p><p>雖然她以充滿節日氣氛的甜美造型亮相，但現場無修圖照片流出後，其臉上過於搶眼的打亮妝容卻意外成為全網熱議焦點。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T09:16:25.795899+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T09:01:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:09:49.190389+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T09:09:49.190389+00:00","content_hash":"0d48baedbe2f02e895a073d1dca225a97ea10ea9e12369b635044772e8c62a34","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}